Section 3 - Data

Data Attribution

The CSV files in this repository (chimefrbcat1_data.csv, chimefrbcat2.csv,
catalog1.csv, repeaters.csv, and related files) are derived from the CHIME/FRB
public catalog releases. These files are not covered by the code or
documentation licenses above. Users should refer to the CHIME/FRB
Collaboration's original data release terms. See DATA_SOURCES.md for
attribution details.
